   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide cash assistance and much-needed services for vulnerable households that are most at risk of malnutrition (SFD) _ ECRP AF2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Cash for Nutrition (CfN) subcomponent will finance cash transfers (CTs) and complementary health and nutrition services to eligible households that have pregnant/lactating women, mothers with children under five or mothers with children with disabilities up to the age of 17 years old in governorates and subdistricts to be identified through the geo-bundling targeting process.</narrative>
  </description>
